# The PyPI package is the algorithm only. The interface sources (web/) and the
# figure studio (simulations/) live in the repo but never ship in the sdist or
# wheel. The *built* Studio interface does ship, as package data in
# ds_msp/studio/static (written there by `npm run build:studio` before `python -m build`). The wheel already contains only
# ds_msp* (see [tool.setuptools.packages.find]); this keeps the sdist lean too.
prune web
prune simulations
global-exclude *.tsbuildinfo *.map .DS_Store
